{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d7316d8e3df9b667322700e13bc4e8117431db88e7e0ff27793e23d98b2b3618", "ja": "（39プロジェクトオーディションに応募してくれた\n子達とは、できるだけ多く会うのが社長の方針だ）", "zh": "（社长希望能尽量多多面试\n来报名39PROJECT甄选的人。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "b4a5fe7f5ca4940c60dbd342854aa62ef11d7ad65c47c24c9ac59846a52c934c", "ja": "や、やぶきっ……か、かにゃっ！\n矢吹かにゃです！　じぅ……、よっ、4歳です！", "zh": "我、我叫做矢、矢吹……可、可麦！\n矢吹可麦！十……四、4岁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bfef642089ee7e93b58fe52e82e09baebecd49a7591f73ef66a8fe4dc40b4bc5", "ja": "（4歳……？）", "zh": "（4岁……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c27213a97fa2b229a5db54fb1b041d86a8c1da9f81b13600f41ceac4a3213f0f", "ja": "えっと、矢吹可奈さんだよね。\nそう緊張しなくていいから、気を楽にして。", "zh": "我看看，你是矢吹可奈小姐对吧？\n不用这么紧张，放轻松点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "2f3e07b498d9590564b4f2fa2bddc9345dd401768471fd2f690c0f0846665237", "ja": "は、はいっ、ありがとうございますっ！\nき、気を楽に……楽にいこ～、ゴ～ゴゴ～……。", "zh": "好、好的！谢谢你！\n放、放轻松……我要放松～Go～GoGo……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1b182a38ff2abf6357cedded20c5a025e45e532b7f18c195edc46c94f8e32adc", "ja": "（ん？　何か聞こえたような……気のせいか？）", "zh": "（嗯？我好像听到什么怪声……是我听错了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a8d90e8ca8b62f1744d546f07f7111e7ed711ca53af68b3548bf3c5a0ffe0c8c", "ja": "コホン。え～っと、\nこのオーディションには、自分で応募を？", "zh": "咳咳，那么～\n你是自己报名这个甄选的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "b2b6ece39f2d300c690133766c193a9e71b28f3e82c0205185dfe2a5af4bf068", "ja": "は、はいっ！　なんども書き間違えちゃいましたけど、\nりれき書も、お小遣いで……な、何枚も買いました！", "zh": "是、是的！虽然我一直填错资料，\n不过、我拿零用钱……买、买了好几张履历表！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7d937398fc2c22486e1ad58bcacebf78ec904f92f8ef0950c26f9e058ab21dac", "ja": "（やる気はすごくあるみたいだな。\nだから、こんなに緊張してるのか）", "zh": "（看来她干劲十足。\n也因为如此才这么紧张吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3db733f5b451a97beb768e7e65b978d72fff6e0ab04460bdc0b070727437567b", "ja": "それじゃ、このオーディションを受けようと思った\n理由を聞かせてもらえるかな。", "zh": "那么，可以说说你为什么\n会来参加本次甄选吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "32376d1bf85fa167a7211ca1e8ca1e75a62e4ceaf64f851e1e0a31ea5fbe46f3", "ja": "そ、それは～……。あの、私、765プロのみんな……\n皆さんが、大好きなんです！", "zh": "是、是因为……那个、我很喜欢……\n很喜欢765艺能的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "b34ef097040acdd71b83c6f97441e07e29a3a1a4a81a8a4a6b703b2c944edc4f", "ja": "本当に、すっごくすっごく憧れてるんですっ。\nそれで～……。", "zh": "我真的非常非常崇拜她们！\n所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9ee018dc694e79d23f60c69740c1f2bbe2eda1d83e4109f366bf36048fe67d3e", "ja": "なるほど。それで自分も、\n同じようなアイドルになりたくなって？", "zh": "原来如此。所以你自己也想成为\n像她们一样的偶像，是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "2e1476bbbc50026198d3f420d80f774934faf9cac4657b94d2ae9a83709330d6", "ja": "は、はいっ。……私、なにかあると、すぐにしょんぼり\nしたり、寂しくなっちゃうんですけど。", "zh": "是、是的……我这个人一遇到挫折，\n总是马上垂头丧气、闷闷不乐的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "5f170e5b8f5d420a0b8d594a2f94754df7ffdea170b7edebed35098b92a3498f", "ja": "そんな時でも、TVの中の春香ちゃ……っ、\n春香さんとか、千早さんとかの歌を聞くと……。", "zh": "但那种时候只要听到电视上的小春香……\n啊，我是说春香和千早她们的歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "97d2a8801c0a697db8b019bee6a0d1ee18da3e9578c85bb9af47d62e96aabf30", "ja": "胸の中のくよくよが、なくなっていくんです。\n楽しいとかうれしいとか、そんな気持ちがわいてきて！", "zh": "我心里的不愉快就会全部不见，\n开心、快乐的心情也跟着冒出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e59ab6d6dc32c4497eff017af2b604f0144ddac08fd15f64f1846bdfc1f440d9", "ja": "（その時のことを思い出しているのか、\nすごく生き生きし始めたぞ……？）", "zh": "（她好像是回想起当下的心境，\n变得神采奕奕……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "b84b3f2ff61ffeb15f1ddc6d4f92bff5c09a7c536b571e78e46b3cb6c449fab1", "ja": "それで私も、春香さん達みたいに……\nあ、すぐには絶対ムリだってわかってます。でも……！", "zh": "所以我也想和春香她们一样……\n啊，我知道不可能马上办到。不过……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "b3743ea0d867d1ae651341654d693df1414991bd3c31ab36a35c1132c6281d4a", "ja": "いつか、なれないかな～、なれたらいいな～って。\nえへへ……。", "zh": "不知道以后办不办得到～要是可以就太好了～\n嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0bc7769acb96b8e7a99665acb032c12221b9009b24504a43b24af6a3e70af575", "ja": "（アイドルへの強い憧れと、どこまでも真っ直ぐで\nひたむきで、そして純粋な笑顔……！）", "zh": "（对于偶像的强烈向往，还有那无比直率、\n专注、而且单纯的笑容……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_1020", "source_sha256": "7f8354a6527db909d196ec480e15d6a619dba6369e42758706f5d9526ae4c968", "ja": "合格！", "zh": "录取！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "6bcfeebd65a18bcbfc1e069d9a8c0a30180fc945c0e0d083ba9e5d454d90a89b", "ja": "よし、合格だ！\nその夢に向かって、一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "很好，你录取了！\n一起努力朝向你的梦想迈进吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_2001_036kan", "source_sha256": "42cd19ab9aea6b0c0e5babc7b6c52607593bca9117fa3e4023196fa1762a21cc", "ja": "えええっ！？　ご、合格……って、私がですか！？\n本当に？　え、ど、どど、ドッキリとかじゃなく……？", "zh": "咦咦咦！？录、录取……我录取了吗！？\n真的吗？呃、应、应应、应该不是在整人吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "43bccd2dd3acbb1dfd6a05b336b2e519c27e7c8568d973d84f1f61942658528a", "ja": "本当だよ。真っ直ぐにアイドルになろうとする君には、\nきっと、たくさんの人が共感してくれると思う。", "zh": "千真万确。你如此率真地想要成为偶像，\n我想一定会有很多人能感同身受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_2003_036kan", "source_sha256": "807e931458c8ff12bb01b5b68562728fac5c9128a919f13ac2278809c078f942", "ja": "そ、それじゃ私……本当に……\nアイドルになれるんですね！？", "zh": "所、所以我……真的……\n可以当上偶像了是吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_2004_036kan", "source_sha256": "3bfeb6b0441de7bdaca315e8ba94a8eaf1d32dc2dd07c63db8f39ed7d52d8455", "ja": "やっ、やった～！　やったやった～♪　やったった～♪\n可奈も今日からアイドル～♪", "zh": "太、太好了～！太好了太好了～♪太好啦啦～♪\n可奈从今天起也是偶像啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_2005_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_2006_036kan", "source_sha256": "928731b74b8c182b71cdba309697b02b985741b3dcc454da640c7e5e42e226fd", "ja": "いち・にい・さん・し、ごうかく～♪\nアイドル目指して、可奈ゴ～ゴゴ～♪", "zh": "一、二、三、四、五、录取～♪\n迈向偶像，可奈GO～GOGO～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_2007_p", "source_sha256": "73472f3db57143e08a9958a557c0bccfa680b43121e4775b1ed49412d8eff0fa", "ja": "えっと……。\nその呪文みたいなのは……何かな？", "zh": "不好意思……\n你念的那些像咒语的东西……是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_2008_036kan", "source_sha256": "283cfca934309eecd3d0a97fb7586df4a3b331f27a508af184d785c115d8c699", "ja": "はれっ！？　ううう、すいません～！\n私、つい歌っちゃって……！", "zh": "咦！？呜呜呜，对不起～！\n我不小心就唱出来了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_2009_036kan", "source_sha256": "eea5a8588eca7dd2caf7861be3b4537ae7117ce7d994f1acd002133eb88677e7", "ja": "あ、あの、改めまして……。", "zh": "那、那个，我再自我介绍一次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_2010_036kan", "source_sha256": "6dee0edd9f96db1a0a0a5b3e86a15a3c20af29976b31b62ccbf912d22b8dbcea", "ja": "矢吹可奈、14歳です。\n特技は、なんでも歌にすること……です。えへ♪", "zh": "我叫矢吹可奈，今年14岁。\n专长是能将任何东西改编成歌……就是这样。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_2011_p", "source_sha256": "3313fba81a9c6024f89e687a51ea9b4c3f54c91f3b71c4d254f1759ce97a7172", "ja": "（彼女の歌が耳から離れない……。俺はもしかして、\n物凄い新人を合格させてしまったんじゃ……？）", "zh": "（她的歌声好有魔性……\n莫非我录取了一位不得了的新人……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_036kan_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_036kan_001_2012_p", "source_sha256": "03ad038b1e86ba2eaefdb9652be13917c22edbeaa38e87ded09dea8fbb8b45b7", "ja": "（『気になる』というのはアイドルにとって、\n何よりの武器……プロデュースしがいがありそうだ！）", "zh": "（『令人在意』对于一个偶像来说\n是无比强大的武器……看来她十分值得培育！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
